    @* The React original uses shadcn's <Dialog> (original/blocks/crud/crud-status-workflow.tsx:8).
       The port hand-rolled a bare overlay div, which dropped Escape-to-close, the focus trap and
       role=""dialog"" — a keyboard user could open this and not get out. DialogCn restores all of
       that, and matches the original. *@
    <DialogCn @bind-Open=""_showDialog"">
        <DialogContentCn>
            <DialogHeaderCn>
                <DialogTitleCn>@GetTransitionLabel(_targetStatus)</DialogTitleCn>
                <DialogDescriptionCn>@GetTransitionDescription(_targetStatus)</DialogDescriptionCn>
